{#-
  Shared hero image for prose pages (blog posts AND docs). Renders only when
  the page declares an explicit `heroImage`. The OG card is a social
  link-unfurl asset, never a visible page hero, so there is deliberately no
  `ogImage` fallback here — pages without a real hero render nothing.
  Kept in one partial so docs and blog never drift apart.
-#}
{%- if heroImage -%}
<figure class="prose-hero">
  <img class="prose-hero__img" src="{{ heroImage }}"
       srcset="{{ heroImage | replace('.webp', '-800.webp') }} 800w, {{ heroImage }} 1600w"
       sizes="(max-width: 48rem) calc(100vw - 3rem), 48rem"
       alt="{{ heroImageAlt | default(title) }}"
       width="{{ heroImageWidth | default('1200') }}" height="{{ heroImageHeight | default('630') }}"
       loading="eager" decoding="async">
</figure>
{%- endif -%}
